flowchart LR
  click[data-track attributes] --> queue[in-memory queue]
  dwell[section dwell timer] --> queue
  queue -->|25 events, page hide| beacon[sendBeacon /api/track]
  beacon --> filter[drop bots, admins, cross-origin, floods]
  filter --> hash[daily visitor hash]
  hash --> events[(analytics_events, 90 days)]
  events --> daily[(analytics_daily, forever)]
  daily --> dash[dashboard: rolled days + live today]
